<Base title="Coaching for a message that sounds like you" description="Work with Loren on message clarity, story structure, delivery, and presence. Coaching for leaders, founders, and emerging speakers."><section class="wrap service-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">COACHING / YOUR VOICE</p><h1>You have<br/>something<br/><span class="gold-text">to say.</span></h1><p>For leaders, founders, and emerging speakers who want to communicate with clarity. Work on what you mean, how you structure it, and how you deliver it.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=coaching">Discuss coaching ↗</a></div><figure><Image src={portrait} alt="Loren Michaels Harris seated outdoors" widths={[400,700,1000]} sizes="(max-width:767px) 100vw, 45vw" loading="eager"/><figcaption>Photograph: Scott R. Gane</figcaption></figure></section><section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE WORK WE CAN DO TOGETHER</p><h2>Find the message.<br/>Build the confidence to share it.</h2><div class="topic-columns"><article><h3>Message clarity</h3><p>Identify what you want people to understand and why it matters. Bring a leadership challenge, a talk, or a story you’re struggling to express.</p></article><article><h3>Story structure</h3><p>Find the thread that connects your experience to your audience. Shape the material into a message people can follow.</p></article><article><h3>Delivery & presence</h3><p>Explore how you communicate the message through your voice, pacing, and connection with the room.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">A FORMAT THAT FITS THE WORK</p><h2>Start with the goal.<br/>Then discuss the support.</h2><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature"><h3>Individual & focused coaching</h3><p>Discuss ongoing work on your communication or a focused engagement around an important message. Cadence, availability, and scope are agreed directly.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/?service=coaching">Tell us what you’re working on ↗</a></article><article class="feature"><p class="eyebrow">LOOKING FOR THE NAMED PROGRAM?</p><h3>The Mindset Revolution</h3><p>A separate program exploring the beliefs and experiences that shape how you see yourself and move forward.</p><a class="text-link" href="/the-mindset-revolution/">Explore the program ↗</a></article></div></section><section class="section story-section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST CONVERSATION</p><h2>Bring the question<br/>you keep coming back to.</h2></div><div><p>Tell Loren what you want to work on, where you feel stuck, and whether you have a particular event or deadline in mind.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/?service=coaching">Discuss coaching ↗</a></div></div></section></Base>
